---
interface Props { kind: 'structure' | 'copy' }
const { kind } = Astro.props;
---
<figure>
{kind === 'structure' ? <svg viewBox="0 0 700 370" role="img" aria-labelledby="proto-class-title proto-class-desc">
<title id="proto-class-title">Prototype roles and copy ownership</title><desc id="proto-class-desc">Client asks PrototypeRegistry to create a report. The registry depends on ReportPrototype.copy. ReportTemplate implements that interface and copies its mutable tool list and nested Layout.</desc>
<defs><marker id="proto-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></marker><marker id="proto-realize" viewBox="0 0 12 12" refX="11" refY="6" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" orient="auto"><path d="M1 1 L11 6 L1 11 Z" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="currentColor"/></marker></defs>
<g class="edges"><path d="M180 60 H245" marker-end="url(#proto-arrow)"/><path d="M455 60 H505" marker-end="url(#proto-arrow)"/><path d="M595 180 V105" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#proto-realize)"/><path d="M505 220 H360 V285" marker-end="url(#proto-arrow)"/><path d="M595 250 V285" marker-end="url(#proto-arrow)"/></g>
<g class="nodes"><rect x="20" y="35" width="160" height="50"/><rect x="245" y="25" width="210" height="75"/><rect x="505" y="15" width="185" height="90"/><rect x="505" y="180" width="185" height="70"/><rect x="265" y="285" width="185" height="55"/><rect x="505" y="285" width="185" height="55"/></g>
<g class="labels"><text x="100" y="65">Client</text><text x="350" y="52">PrototypeRegistry</text><text x="350" y="80">create(name)</text><text x="597" y="40">«interface»</text><text x="597" y="65">ReportPrototype</text><text x="597" y="88">copy()</text><text x="597" y="207">ReportTemplate</text><text x="597" y="232">copy(): ReportTemplate</text><text x="357" y="317">List&lt;String&gt; tools</text><text x="597" y="317">Layout</text><text x="350" y="356" class="annotation">Each copy owns a new list and a new Layout.</text><text x="390" y="247" class="annotation">owns</text><text x="630" y="274" class="annotation">owns</text></g>
</svg> : <svg viewBox="0 0 700 400" role="img" aria-labelledby="proto-copy-title proto-copy-desc">
<title id="proto-copy-title">Copy workflow and state isolation</title><desc id="proto-copy-desc">Register captures a copy of the original. Each create call copies that stored prototype. The original, stored prototype, and customized report own separate mutable lists and layouts, while immutable strings may be shared.</desc>
<defs><marker id="proto-copy-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></marker></defs>
<g class="edges" marker-end="url(#proto-copy-arrow)"><path d="M210 70 H260"/><path d="M445 70 H495"/><path d="M115 115 V190"/><path d="M352 115 V190"/><path d="M587 115 V190"/></g>
<g class="nodes"><rect x="20" y="25" width="190" height="90"/><rect x="260" y="25" width="185" height="90"/><rect x="495" y="25" width="190" height="90"/><rect x="20" y="190" width="190" height="100"/><rect x="260" y="190" width="185" height="100"/><rect x="495" y="190" width="190" height="100"/></g>
<g class="labels"><text x="115" y="55">Original</text><text x="115" y="82">Engineering Tools</text><text x="352" y="55">Stored prototype</text><text x="352" y="82">Engineering Tools</text><text x="590" y="55">Customized copy</text><text x="590" y="82">Software Tools</text><text x="235" y="145" class="annotation">register → copy()</text><text x="470" y="145" class="annotation">create → copy()</text><text x="115" y="220">tools: Cameo, Windchill</text><text x="115" y="252">footer: Internal review</text><text x="352" y="220">tools: Cameo, Windchill</text><text x="352" y="252">footer: Internal review</text><text x="590" y="220">tools: + GitLab</text><text x="590" y="252">footer: Draft</text><text x="350" y="335">Separate mutable objects; no shared list or Layout.</text><text x="350" y="365" class="annotation">Immutable String values can be shared safely.</text></g>
</svg>}
<figcaption>{kind === 'structure' ? 'The optional registry depends on the copy contract; the concrete prototype knows its own construction details. Hollow triangle: implements.' : 'Runtime copy workflow: registration and retrieval both copy, keeping template edits and result edits isolated.'}</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>figure{margin:28px 0;overflow-x:auto}svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;min-width:560px;padding:10px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}.edges{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5}.nodes rect{fill:var(--soft);stroke:var(--line);rx:5}.labels{text-anchor:middle;fill:var(--ink);font:13px system-ui,sans-serif}.annotation{fill:var(--muted);font-size:12px}figcaption{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:9px}@media print{svg{min-width:0}}</style>
